  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maharashtra Project on Climate Resilient Agriculture Phase - II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve Resilience and promote sustainable agriculture with the following four pillars viz: 	Pillar 1 - Resource Efficient Productivity Enhancement; Pillar 2 - Promoting Precision Agriculture for Emissions Management; Pillar 3- Improving and Building Income Resilience; Pillar 4 - Lighthouse Approach for Strengthening Institutions. The details of these pillars will be discussed with the client and the task team, will be finalised during project preparation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective (PDO) is to improve resilience and profitability of smallholder farmers across selected districts in Maharashtra.</narrative>
  </description>
